{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656322",
      "title": "Setting up Child (Nested) Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 464,
      "videoOrder": 426,
      "sourceHash": "d36b88ff9360336023be0d2eda611da7bf985ebe148f0d94da23fabc833a46a8",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.79,
          "end": 5.13,
          "en": "-: We improved out app quite a bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.13,
          "end": 7.02,
          "en": "But the issue we have is that if you click",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.02,
          "end": 10.59,
          "en": "on a server or a user, you load a brand new page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.59,
          "end": 13.68,
          "en": "It would be nicer if it would load it next to this menu.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.68,
          "end": 16.44,
          "en": "So we need some nested routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.44,
          "end": 19.68,
          "en": "We can also see that in the app module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.68,
          "end": 23.22,
          "en": "we kind of have some duplication here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.22,
          "end": 25.83,
          "en": "All these routes here start with servers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.83,
          "end": 28.05,
          "en": "and all these routes with users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.05,
          "end": 31.02,
          "en": "So it would be nice to nest them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.02,
          "end": 33.51,
          "en": "and to have some child routes which all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.51,
          "end": 35.73,
          "en": "start with servers down here in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.73,
          "end": 36.87,
          "en": "for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.87,
          "end": 39,
          "en": "Let's add such child routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39,
          "end": 42.3,
          "en": "To do this, I'll go to my servers component route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.3,
          "end": 45.24,
          "en": "to the slash service route, and I'll add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.24,
          "end": 47.76,
          "en": "another property. Children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.76,
          "end": 50.4,
          "en": "Children takes another array of routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.4,
          "end": 54.12,
          "en": "so now I can simply take my two other service routes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.12,
          "end": 58.47,
          "en": "and add them inside of this array as children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.47,
          "end": 61.2,
          "en": "Now, servers should now be removed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.2,
          "end": 62.97,
          "en": "because that is now always prepended at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.97,
          "end": 64.35,
          "en": "the beginning anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.35,
          "end": 66.72,
          "en": "So we have to make sure to get rid of it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.72,
          "end": 70.83,
          "en": "And now we have just ID and ID edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.83,
          "end": 74.76,
          "en": "So this is now already better because now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.76,
          "end": 77.76,
          "en": "we group that together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.76,
          "end": 81.96000000000001,
          "en": "It gives us more than this visual grouping here though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.96000000000001,
          "end": 84.53999999999999,
          "en": "You notice that on the servers here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.53999999999999,
          "end": 88.14,
          "en": "we have the servers component as the, well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.14,
          "end": 90.03,
          "en": "component to be loaded still.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.03,
          "end": 92.46000000000001,
          "en": "The question now is where will these server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.46000000000001,
          "end": 94.05,
          "en": "components be loaded, then?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.05,
          "end": 96.53999999999999,
          "en": "Because that is yet another child route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.53999999999999,
          "end": 98.1,
          "en": "of our service component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 98.1,
          "end": 100.11,
          "en": "And you can see that this is an issue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 100.11,
          "end": 102.87,
          "en": "If we reload our app here, everything's working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 102.87,
          "end": 105.65,
          "en": "If I click on test server, now we get an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.65,
          "end": 109.22999999999999,
          "en": "Because now the error tells us that it cannot find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.22999999999999,
          "end": 112.62,
          "en": "an outlet to load our server component in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.62,
          "end": 115.71000000000001,
          "en": "And indeed it can't because the only route or outlet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 115.71000000000001,
          "end": 119.03999999999999,
          "en": "the only hook in our code where it should load components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.03999999999999,
          "end": 121.65,
          "en": "is in our app component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.65,
          "end": 126.65,
          "en": "Now that is reserved for all our routes on the top level.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.84,
          "end": 131.84,
          "en": "So, slash nothing, slash users, users ID name, and servers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.09,
          "end": 136.62,
          "en": "But the child routes of servers need a separate outlet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.62,
          "end": 138.81,
          "en": "because they can't override the service component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.81,
          "end": 142.07999999999998,
          "en": "Instead, they should be loaded nested into",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 142.07999999999998,
          "end": 143.61,
          "en": "this service component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.61,
          "end": 146.82,
          "en": "And that actually is the behavior we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.82,
          "end": 149.37,
          "en": "So we can quickly get there by going to the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.37,
          "end": 151.74,
          "en": "service component HTML file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.74,
          "end": 154.44,
          "en": "And here where we load the edit page or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.44,
          "end": 156.54,
          "en": "the app server page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.54,
          "end": 159.39,
          "en": "Well here I will simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.39,
          "end": 162.78,
          "en": "comment out all that code and instead add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.78,
          "end": 165.42000000000002,
          "en": "a router outlet here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.42000000000002,
          "end": 168.99,
          "en": "This now adds a new hook which will be used on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.99,
          "end": 172.14,
          "en": "all child routes off the route being loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.14,
          "end": 175.11,
          "en": "on the service component, which of course is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 175.11,
          "end": 177.27,
          "en": "our slash service route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 177.27,
          "end": 179.49,
          "en": "So all these child routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 179.49,
          "end": 182.82,
          "en": "will be loaded in this router out of place now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.82,
          "end": 186.09,
          "en": "So if we save this, and now we let this reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.09,
          "end": 187.23,
          "en": "You don't see anything here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 187.23,
          "end": 189.66,
          "en": "But if I click a server, it's now loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 189.66,
          "end": 192.72,
          "en": "next to the menu because this is where we added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.72,
          "end": 195,
          "en": "our second router outlet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 195,
          "end": 197.4,
          "en": "And this is how you can easily add child routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 197.4,
          "end": 200.1,
          "en": "Let's do the same for the user routes now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.1,
          "end": 203.61,
          "en": "In the app module I'll add children here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 203.61,
          "end": 207.45,
          "en": "So this property which takes an array of routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207.45,
          "end": 210.32999999999998,
          "en": "And I only have one nested route here, but that's fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 210.32999999999998,
          "end": 212.22,
          "en": "So we'll add it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 212.22,
          "end": 214.62,
          "en": "Get rid of the users at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.62,
          "end": 218.25,
          "en": "Just have slash, well, oh, and the ID and name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 218.25,
          "end": 221.61,
          "en": "the two dynamic parameters, and load the user component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 221.61,
          "end": 225.371,
          "en": "And now in my users component HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 225.371,
          "end": 230.1,
          "en": "I'll replace my app user here with another router outlet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 230.1,
          "end": 232.163,
          "en": "where all the user-related child routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 232.163,
          "end": 234.96,
          "en": "or the one user-related child route we have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 234.96,
          "end": 236.61,
          "en": "will be loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 236.61,
          "end": 237.99,
          "en": "So if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.99,
          "end": 240.87,
          "en": "you now see we load the user next to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 240.87,
          "end": 243.12,
          "en": "and that is why it is super important to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 243.12,
          "end": 246,
          "en": "dynamically update the ID and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 246,
          "end": 248.82,
          "en": "Because the component wasn't exchanged,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 248.82,
          "end": 251.49,
          "en": "we were able to switch the loaded user while",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 251.49,
          "end": 254.1,
          "en": "this old component, the user component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 254.1,
          "end": 256.98,
          "en": "the single user component, was already loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 256.98,
          "end": 259.77,
          "en": "And this is how you can implement child routing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 259.77,
          "end": 263.49,
          "en": "nested routes, with this children property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 263.49,
          "end": 266.073,
          "en": "which then holds all the nested routes.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
